45
00:03:48,693 --> 00:03:53,820
not just rely on memory. How we begin the presentation is so important...

46
00:03:53,820 --> 00:03:56,010
MARTIN: You're right.

47
00:03:56,010 --> 00:04:00,692
ROSIE: The discovery of the mammoth tooth is probably the most dramatic part,

48
00:04:00,692 --> 00:04:06,095
